'''Tales of the Past and Present''' is a group of hidden [[Side Quests]] that take place all around [[Solaris-3]]. Each quest is activated, when all [[Torn Pages and Abandoned Data Chips|Torn Pages or Abandoned Data Chips]] are collected from within a [[Region]]. Not all Regions have Torn pages or Abandoned Data Chips. Those that do have them, have 3 or 4. As a reward a data chip or a booklet is obtained. These chips and booklets contain [[Lore]] related to the Region it was collected from.

==Quests In Different Nations==

In [[Huanglong]] the collected Torn Pages or Abandoned Data Chips are taken to the [[Storyteller]], located in [[Jinzhou]] next to the Theater.

In [[Ragunna]] the Torn pages are delivered to [[Fuling]] in [[Egla Town]]. Unlocking these Quests in Ragunna requires {{Quest|Immortal Blaze}} to be completed.

